  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-language-info-update-0000001158245057#section54750228",
      "text": "此接口用于更新指定应用的语言描述信息，如果当前没有语言描述信息则新增。接口调用者的角色：账号持有者、管理员、APP管理员、运营。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-language-info-update-0000001158245057#section48771100566",
      "text": "API客户端方式和OAuth客户端方式的区别请参见使用入门。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-language-info-update-0000001158245057#section48771100566",
      "text": "API客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-language-info-update-0000001158245057#section48771100566",
      "text": "OAuth客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-language-info-update-0000001158245057#section13576204051611",
      "text": "请求Body中使用JSON格式携带更新的语言描述信息，参数如下表所示。"
    },
